 <proxy>
 <host>corporate-proxy.com</host>
 <port>8080</port>
 </proxy>
</proxies>
```

#### **IDE có thể download schema qua proxy:**
```
✅ Corporate network cho phép download XSD
✅ IDE cache schema locally
✅ Team share cached schemas
